e\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">12 Types of Digital Marketing<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The main&nbsp;types of digital marketing&nbsp;include SEO, PPC advertising, Social Media Marketing (SMM), Content Marketing,&nbsp;Email Marketing, Influence Marketing, Affiliate Marketing, Video Marketing, Mobile Marketing, Search Engine Marketing, Display Advertising, and Online PR.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Let\u2019s&nbsp;these&nbsp;all digital&nbsp;marketing types in detail:<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/types-digital-marketing.webp\" alt=\"12 Types of Digital Marketing\" class=\"wp-image-20644\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/types-digital-marketing.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/types-digital-marketing-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/types-digital-marketing-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/types-digital-marketing-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/types-digital-marketing-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Search Engine Optimization (SEO)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO&nbsp;is the process of&nbsp;optimizing&nbsp;your&nbsp;website&nbsp;so it ranks higher on Google and other search engines. When people search for something, you want your page to appear on top. SEO includes using the right <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-keywords\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">keywords<\/a>, improving page speed, creating quality content, and getting backlinks from trusted sites.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO helps bring free (organic) traffic to your website and builds credibility over time.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you run a blog about digital marketing and your article \u201c<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-free-seo-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Best SEO Tools<\/a>\u201d appears on the first page of Google, that\u2019s SEO success.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-5958c5fecb31b1d3b68b4c6d19e489b0\"><em><strong>Pro Tip:<\/strong>&nbsp;SEO is a long-term strategy. Focus on creating helpful content consistently rather than chasing quick rankings.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Pay-Per-Click Advertising (PPC)&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In&nbsp;PPC advertising, you pay only when someone clicks on your ad. These ads appear on platforms like Google, Bing, or social media. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-ppc\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">PPC<\/a> helps you reach customers instantly and is ideal for generating quick results.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can target specific keywords, locations, and audiences.&nbsp;It\u2019s&nbsp;measurable, so you can track how much you spend and earn per click.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>An online shoe brand runs Google Ads for \u201cbuy running shoes online.\u201d Every time someone clicks and visits their site, they pay a small amount,&nbsp;maybe \u20b95&nbsp;or \u20b910.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Social Media Marketing (SMM)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Social Media Marketing means using platforms like Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, or Twitter (X) to connect with your audience. You can share posts, run ads, and engage with followers.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It\u2019s&nbsp;great for brand awareness, customer loyalty, and even direct sales. Social media lets you reach millions of users based on their age, interest, and behavior.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Zomato\u2019s humorous and trending Instagram posts grab huge attention and engagement. They&nbsp;don\u2019t&nbsp;just sell food; they connect emotionally with users.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Content Marketing<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/content-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Content marketing<\/a> focuses on creating and sharing valuable content, like blogs, videos, guides, or infographics, to educate and attract potential customers. Instead of direct selling, you provide useful information that builds trust and authority.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Good content&nbsp;keeps your audience coming back and positions you as an expert in your field.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.hubspot.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">HubSpot<\/a> publishes free marketing guides and blogs that help readers learn. Over time, these readers become their paying customers.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Email Marketing<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/email-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Email marketing<\/a>&nbsp;is one of the oldest yet most effective digital marketing types.&nbsp;It\u2019s&nbsp;all about sending personalized emails to your audience through newsletters, offers, updates, or reminders.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It helps nurture leads,&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;relationships, and drive repeat sales. You can track open rates, clicks, and conversions easily.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.flipkart.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Flipkart<\/a> sends festive season discount emails with&nbsp;special deals&nbsp;for loyal customers, driving thousands of daily sales.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Influencer Marketing<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In influencer marketing, brands collaborate with popular individuals on social media who have large, engaged audiences. These influencers promote the brand\u2019s products through posts, videos, or stories.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It works well because people trust influencers they follow, and their recommendations feel more genuine than traditional ads.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>A skincare brand partners with a YouTuber who reviews their new moisturizer and shares a discount code, leading to more sales.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T123426_340_1785490284771_211381.webp\" alt=\"AI Engineering Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/how-to-build-an-ai-agent-from-scratch?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-03T133829_740__1__1786010890597_768466.webp\" alt=\"How to Build an AI Agent from Scratch \" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/soc-analyst-career-demand-in-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-04T111115_404_1786011909630_974751.webp\" alt=\"SOC Analyst Career Demand in 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/booming-digital-marketing-career-in-ai-era?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-07T104930_382_1786105407836_186872.webp\" alt=\"Booming Digital Marketing Career in AI Era\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cybersecurity-professional-career-roadmap-2026-2?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Affiliate Marketing<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/affiliate-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Affiliate marketing<\/a>&nbsp;is a partnership-based system where others promote your products for a commission.&nbsp;It\u2019s&nbsp;like word-of-mouth marketing, but online and&nbsp;performance-based.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You only pay affiliates when they bring actual results, such as a sale or signup, making it a low-risk marketing type.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Amazon\u2019s Affiliate Program pays bloggers a small percentage of every sale made through their referral links.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Video Marketing<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Video marketing involves using videos to promote your products or explain your services.&nbsp;It\u2019s&nbsp;one of the most engaging forms of digital marketing because people prefer watching over reading.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Videos can be used on YouTube, Instagram Reels, Facebook, or&nbsp;even&nbsp;your website. They boost engagement, trust, and conversions.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Nike\u2019s motivational YouTube ads featuring athletes inspire millions while subtly promoting their products.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. Mobile Marketing<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Mobile marketing focuses on reaching users on smartphones and tablets. It includes SMS marketing, mobile ads, in-app notifications, and mobile-friendly websites.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Since most people use their phones daily,&nbsp;it\u2019s&nbsp;one of the most effective online marketing types for modern audiences.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Swiggy sends push notifications like \u201cYour favorite restaurant has 30% off today\u201d, instantly bringing users back to the app.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Search Engine Marketing (SEM)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/search-engine-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Search Engine Marketing&nbsp;(SEM)<\/a> is a combination of SEO and PPC. It helps you appear both in paid ads and organic search results. SEM gives faster visibility compared to SEO alone and ensures your brand dominates search engines.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>A digital marketing course provider uses Google Ads (PPC) for immediate traffic and SEO for long-term ranking; a perfect SEM mix.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">11. Display Advertising<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Display advertising uses banner ads, images, and videos that appear on websites, apps, or YouTube. These ads help increase brand recall and visibility.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can target audiences based on their interests, demographics, or&nbsp;previous&nbsp;browsing behavior.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>A travel agency runs banner ads for \u201cSummer Holiday Packages\u201d that appear when users browse news sites or watch YouTube.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">12. Online Public Relations (PR)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Online PR helps manage a brand\u2019s reputation digitally. It includes writing press releases, collaborating with bloggers, handling online reviews, and publishing brand news on trusted websites.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This builds authority, trust, and credibility with both customers and search engines.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Example:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>A startup publishes success stories and interviews on top news websites like&nbsp;YourStory&nbsp;or Economic Times to boost visibility.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Digital Marketing Campaigns&nbsp;and Their Primary Goals<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>While each marketing channel serves a unique purpose, understanding their primary goals can help you choose the right strategy for your business.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Digital Marketing Type<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Primary Goal<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>SEO&nbsp;<\/td><td>Drive long-term organic traffic&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>PPC Advertising&nbsp;<\/td><td>Generate immediate traffic and leads&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Social Media Marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>Increase brand awareness and engagement&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Content Marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>Build trust and authority&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Email Marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>Nurture leads and&nbsp;retain&nbsp;customers&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Influencer Marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>Expand reach and build credibility&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Affiliate Marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>Drive performance-based sales&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Video Marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>Boost engagement and conversions&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Mobile Marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>Reach users on mobile devices&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Search Engine Marketing (SEM)&nbsp;<\/td><td>Improve search visibility&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Display Advertising&nbsp;<\/td><td>Increase brand visibility and recall&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Online PR&nbsp;<\/td><td>Strengthen brand reputation and trust&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This comparison provides a quick overview of the&nbsp;different types&nbsp;of digital marketing&nbsp;and the key&nbsp;objective&nbsp;each channel helps businesses achieve.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-2acca074453686850bf9967756d55941\"><em><strong>Expert Advice:<\/strong>&nbsp;There&#8217;s&nbsp;no single best type of digital marketing. The most successful brands combine multiple channels to create a balanced strategy.&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-906773decfaaf860da702971b31acf8b\"><strong>Expand Your Marketing Skills<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/impact-of-ai-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Impact of AI in Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to Make Money in Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to Learn Digital Marketing at Home<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/poem-framework-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Poem Framework in Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-syllabus\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course Syllabus<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/will-ai-replace-digital-marketers\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Will AI Replace Digital Marketers<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-salary-india\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Salary in India<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-does-it-take-to-learn-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How Long to Learn Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-advantages-disadvantages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pros and Cons of Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-platforms\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Best Digital Marketing Platforms<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Best Digital Marketing Tools<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/benefits-of-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Benefits<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/ai-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI in Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/future-scope-of-digital-marketing-india\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Scope of Digital Marketing in India<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-trends\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Trends<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-channels\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Channels<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-future\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Future of Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-terminologies\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Terminologies<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Choose the Right&nbsp;Type of Digital Marketing<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>With so many marketing channels available, choosing the right&nbsp;type of digital marketing&nbsp;can feel overwhelming. The best strategy depends on your goals, audience, budget, and business needs. Here are some factors to consider:<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-choose-right-type-of-digital-marketing.webp\" alt=\"How to Choose the Right\u00a0Type of Digital Marketing\" class=\"wp-image-20645\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-choose-right-type-of-digital-marketing.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-choose-right-type-of-digital-marketing-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-choose-right-type-of-digital-marketing-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-choose-right-type-of-digital-marketing-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-choose-right-type-of-digital-marketing-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Define Your Goals:<\/strong>&nbsp;Determine&nbsp;whether you want to increase brand awareness, generate leads, drive website traffic, or boost sales.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand Your Audience:<\/strong>&nbsp;Identify&nbsp;where your target customers spend their time online and which platforms they use most.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Consider Your Budget:<\/strong>&nbsp;Some strategies, such as SEO, require time and consistency, while PPC advertising delivers faster results but requires ongoing investment.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Evaluate Your Resources:<\/strong>&nbsp;Choose channels that match your team&#8217;s skills and available resources for content creation and campaign management.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Track Performance:<\/strong>&nbsp;Use analytics tools to measure results and&nbsp;identify&nbsp;which marketing efforts deliver the best return on investment.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Test and Optimize:<\/strong>&nbsp;Start with a few channels, analyze performance, and refine your strategy based on real data.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The most effective approach is often a combination of&nbsp;different&nbsp;types&nbsp;of digital marketing campaigns&nbsp;working together to achieve your business&nbsp;objectives.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Examples of Digital Marketing Campaigns&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Learning from real brands helps you see how different digital marketing types work together in practice.&nbsp;Let\u2019s&nbsp;look at some powerful campaigns that made a real impact.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Nike \u2013 \u201cJust Do It\u201d Digital Storytelling Campaign&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing Types Used:<\/strong>&nbsp;Video Marketing, Social Media Marketing, Influencer Marketing&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nike.in\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Nike<\/a> is known for its emotional storytelling and inspirational messaging. Its famous \u201cJust Do It\u201d campaign became a global sensation because it&nbsp;didn\u2019t&nbsp;just sell shoes; it sold a mindset of confidence and determination. It is the best&nbsp;example of digital marketing.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In recent years, Nike extended this campaign digitally by using short videos, YouTube ads, and influencer collaborations. The brand featured athletes like Serena Williams and everyday fitness enthusiasts sharing their personal journeys.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>These videos went viral on social media, driving millions of&nbsp;shares&nbsp;and boosting Nike\u2019s brand engagement worldwide.&nbsp;It\u2019s&nbsp;a perfect example of video and social media marketing working together to build emotional connections and brand loyalty.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Coca-Cola \u2013 \u201cShare a Coke\u201d Campaign&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing Types Used:<\/strong>&nbsp;Social Media Marketing, Content Marketing, Personalization&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Coca-Cola\u2019s \u201cShare a Coke\u201d campaign started by printing people\u2019s names on Coke bottles, turning an everyday product into something personal and shareable.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Online, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.coca-cola.com\/in\/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Coca-Cola<\/a> encouraged users to find bottles with their names and post photos on Facebook, Instagram, and Twitter with the hashtag #ShareACoke. This created millions of user-generated posts and stories across social media.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The campaign not only increased Coca-Cola\u2019s sales but also built a deep emotional connection with customers.&nbsp;It\u2019s&nbsp;a classic example of social media marketing combined with personalized content marketing that went viral globally.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Amazon \u2013 Targeted PPC and Email Marketing&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing Types Used:&nbsp;<\/strong>PPC Advertising, Email Marketing, Retargeting&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Amazon<\/a> is a master at combining multiple <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-channels\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing channel<\/a>s to drive conversions. When you search for a product on Amazon or Google,&nbsp;you\u2019ll&nbsp;likely see&nbsp;Amazon\u2019s ads appear at the top. That\u2019s PPC advertising and&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-performance-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">performance marketing<\/a>&nbsp;in action.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you view a product but&nbsp;don\u2019t&nbsp;buy it, Amazon sends reminder emails or shows you that same product in ads later. This is retargeting and email marketing working together.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This smart combination of personalized ads and follow-up emails helps Amazon recover lost sales and increase repeat purchases.&nbsp;It\u2019s&nbsp;one of the best examples of data-driven performance marketing.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Swiggy \u2013 Engaging Push Notifications and Social Media Campaigns&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing Types Used:<\/strong>&nbsp;Mobile Marketing, Social Media Marketing, Content Marketing&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.swiggy.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Swiggy<\/a> knows how to grab attention. It uses creative push notifications that make you smile, laugh, and sometimes even feel hungry! Messages like \u201cDon\u2019t&nbsp;cook today. You deserve a break!\u201d or \u201cYour burger misses you!\u201d create engagement instantly.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>On social media, Swiggy runs witty posts, contests, and food challenges that encourage participation. The #SwiggyVoiceOfHunger campaign on Instagram, where users used voice notes shaped like food items, was a huge hit.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Swiggy\u2019s approach shows how humor, creativity, and personalization can turn simple mobile marketing and social media content into viral brand engagement.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Zomato \u2013 Real-Time Social Media Marketing&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing Types Used:<\/strong> Social Media Marketing, Meme Marketing, Content Marketing&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.zomato.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Zomato<\/a> has mastered the art of real-time digital marketing. The brand uses humor, memes, and trending topics to stay relevant every day. Its posts are short, funny, and highly shareable, making Zomato one of India\u2019s most loved social media brands.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, during the 2023 cricket season, Zomato shared relatable food memes that went viral instantly. Their ability to react to trending events and use creative content keeps audiences engaged and entertained, while subtly promoting food delivery.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Zomato\u2019s campaigns prove that content + timing + humor can create magic online.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Spotify \u2013 \u201cWrapped\u201d Personalized Campaign&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing Types Used: <\/strong>Email Marketing, Data-Driven Marketing, Social Media Marketing&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Every December, <a href=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Spotify<\/a> releases Spotify Wrapped, a personalized report that shows each user their most-streamed songs, artists, and genres of the year.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Users love sharing their \u201cmusic story,\u201d which drives massive organic promotion for Spotify. The brand also sends customized emails and push notifications encouraging users to check their Wrapped summary.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Millions of people share their results on Instagram and Twitter, making it a viral trend every year. Spotify\u2019s campaign shows how data personalization and content sharing can turn users into brand promoters.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-1ee9d984406e6ff2fa23f770a85445be\"><em><strong>Marketing Insight:<\/strong>&nbsp;Real-world campaigns show how&nbsp;different types&nbsp;of digital marketing work together to create stronger results than a single channel alone.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-d72f351059e80039135382f58233f821\"><strong>Explore Our Most Popular Marketing Courses<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/performance-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Performance Marketing Course<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/ai-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI Course<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits and Challenges of Digital Marketing&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The&nbsp;different types&nbsp;of digital marketing&nbsp;offer unique benefits, but they also present challenges that businesses must overcome to achieve long-term success.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Benefits of Digital Marketing<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Challenges of Digital Marketing<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Reach a global audience with minimal investment&nbsp;<\/td><td>High competition across digital channels&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Target specific audiences based on demographics and interests&nbsp;<\/td><td>Constantly changing algorithms and trends&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Measure campaign performance in real time&nbsp;<\/td><td>Requires continuous learning and skill updates&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>More cost-effective than traditional marketing&nbsp;<\/td><td>Results may take time, especially with SEO&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Enables personalized customer experiences&nbsp;<\/td><td>Managing multiple platforms can be time-consuming&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Supports better customer engagement and interaction&nbsp;<\/td><td>Data privacy regulations can limit targeting options&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Easily scalable for businesses of all sizes&nbsp;<\/td><td>Generating consistent, high-quality content can be challenging&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Digital marketing can deliver&nbsp;significant results&nbsp;when businesses balance its advantages with a well-planned strategy to overcome&nbsp;common challenges.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Future Trends in Digital Marketing<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>As technology evolves, the&nbsp;types of digital marketing&nbsp;businesses use will continue to change. Keeping up with emerging trends can help marketers stay competitive and adapt to changing consumer behavior.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/future-trends-in-digital-marketing.webp\" alt=\"Future Trends in Digital Marketing\" class=\"wp-image-20646\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/future-trends-in-digital-marketing.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/future-trends-in-digital-marketing-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/future-trends-in-digital-marketing-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/future-trends-in-digital-marketing-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/future-trends-in-digital-marketing-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>AI-Powered Personalization:<\/strong>\u00a0Brands will use <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI<\/a> to deliver more personalized content, recommendations, and customer experiences.\u00a0<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Voice Search Optimization:<\/strong>&nbsp;Businesses will increasingly&nbsp;optimize&nbsp;content for voice-based and conversational search queries.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Interactive Content:<\/strong>&nbsp;Quizzes, polls, AR experiences, and interactive tools will become more popular for boosting engagement.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Stronger Data Privacy Practices:<\/strong>&nbsp;Marketers will rely more on first-party data as privacy regulations and cookie restrictions increase.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Short-Form Video Growth:<\/strong>&nbsp;Platforms like Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, and TikTok will continue to drive audience engagement.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp;utm_page=\/types-of-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"380\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program.webp\" alt=\"Digital marketing Course Banner\" class=\"wp-image-14519\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program.webp 1546w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program-300x74.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program-1024x252.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program-768x189.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program-1536x378.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1546px) 100vw, 1546px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs About&nbsp;Digital Marketing Types<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\"><div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959573633\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">1. <strong>What are the types of digital marketing?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The main\u00a0types of digital marketing\u00a0include SEO, PPC advertising, social media marketing, content marketing, email marketing, influencer marketing, affiliate marketing, video marketing, mobile marketing, SEM, display advertising, and online PR. Each channel helps businesses achieve different marketing goals.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959582894\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">2. <strong>Do I need a large budget to start digital marketing?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">No, many digital marketing strategies, such as SEO, content marketing, and social media marketing, can be started with a limited budget. Businesses can scale their investment as they grow.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959597050\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3. <strong>What are the most effective\u00a0types of digital marketing\u00a0for small businesses?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">SEO, content marketing, social media marketing, and email marketing are often the most effective options for small businesses. They offer strong results while\u00a0remaining\u00a0relatively cost-effective.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959613984\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. <strong>Can businesses use multiple\u00a0types of digital marketing\u00a0together?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, combining\u00a0different types\u00a0of digital marketing\u00a0often delivers better results. For example, businesses can use SEO for traffic, social\u00a0media for\u00a0engagement, and email marketing for customer retention.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959629012\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. <strong>What are the main types of digital marketing\u00a0in 2026?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">In 2026, businesses continue to rely on SEO, social media marketing, email marketing, video marketing, PPC advertising, and influencer marketing. AI-powered personalization and short-form video content are also becoming increasingly important.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959750924\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">6. <strong>Which digital marketing channels are most effective today?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The effectiveness of a channel depends on your goals and audience. However, SEO, video marketing, social media marketing, and email marketing consistently deliver strong results across industries.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959767004\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">7. <strong>How can students prepare for a career in digital marketing?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Students can start by learning core concepts, gaining hands-on experience through projects, and enrolling in a digital marketing course. Certifications and internships can also help build practical skills.\u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959782552\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">8. <strong>What is the best\u00a0type of digital marketing\u00a0for beginners?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Social media marketing and content marketing are often considered\u00a0beginner-friendly. They help learners understand audience engagement, content creation, and campaign strategy without requiring a large budget.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959795260\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">9. <strong>How long does it take to see results from digital marketing?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The timeline varies by channel. PPC campaigns can generate results quickly, while SEO and content marketing may take several months to show significant growth.\u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781959808604\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">10. <strong>Why is it important to understand\u00a0different types\u00a0of digital marketing?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Understanding different marketing channels helps businesses choose the right strategies,\u00a0allocate\u00a0resources effectively, and reach their target audience through the most suitable platforms.\u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3cf06b6cdda66c085d83d8acd0831a8e\"><strong>Join Our On-Campus Digital Marketing Program<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/jaipur\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course in Jaipur<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/jodhpur\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course in Jodhpur<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-e1fc883f2a064c2ee23f1a20caaaed0f\"><strong>Explore Our Free Courses<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/google-tag-manager\/free-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Free GTM Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"cent